    "text": "Let <math><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>y</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced></math> be the solution of the differential equation <math><mfrac><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced></math>, where <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><mfenced close=\"\" open=\"{\" separators=\"|\"><mtable><mtr><mtd><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo></mtd><mtd><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo></mtd><mtd><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">h</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">w</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced></math>. If <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi><mo>(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>, then&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi><mi>&#160;</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mfenced></math>&nbsp;is"
